msgid ""
"A shared space for Rwanda's farmers, produce buyers and transporters to plan"
" ahead, find one another and coordinate the next step."
msgstr ""
"Urubuga ruhuza abahinzi, abaguzi b'umusaruro n'abawutwara mu Rwanda kugira "
"ngo bategure hakiri kare, bahurizwe hamwe kandi bategure intambwe ikurikira."

msgid "Join Smart AgroConnect"
msgstr "Injira muri Smart AgroConnect"

msgid "Explore produce listings"
msgstr "Reba umusaruro watangajwe"

msgid "Free to explore · Create a role-based account to participate"
msgstr ""
"Kureba ni ubuntu · Fungura konti uhitamo uruhare rwawe kugira ngo witabire"

msgid "From planting to collection"
msgstr "Kuva ku gutera kugeza ku gutwara umusaruro"

msgid "One connected workflow"
msgstr "Urugendo rumwe ruhuza ibikorwa"

msgid "Make every harvest easier to plan."
msgstr "Tegura isarura ryose mu buryo bworoshye."

msgid ""
"Start with the practical tools. Add trusted local guidance and services as "
"your network grows."
msgstr ""
"Tangira ukoresheje ibikoresho bifatika. Uko urubuga ruguka, wongeremo inama "
"n'ibindi bikorwa byizewe byo hafi."

msgid "Track crops"
msgstr "Kurikirana ibihingwa"

msgid ""
"Record farms, planting dates and expected growing periods. Keep harvest "
"dates clearly labelled as estimates."
msgstr ""
"Andika imirima, amatariki yo gutera n'igihe ibihingwa biteganyijwe kumara "
"bikura. Erekana neza ko amatariki yo gusarura ari ibigereranyo."

msgid "Meet the market"
msgstr "Hura n'isoko"

msgid ""
"Publish expected produce or future demand and discover potential matches "
"before collection day."
msgstr ""
"Tangaza umusaruro uteganyijwe cyangwa ibyo uzakenera, maze umenye "
"abafatanyabikorwa bashoboka mbere y'umunsi wo gutwara."

msgid "Coordinate delivery"
msgstr "Huza ibikorwa byo kugeza umusaruro"

msgid ""
"Manage order agreements and let registered transporters respond to "
"collection requests."
msgstr ""
"Genzura amasezerano ya komande kandi wemere abatwara ibicuruzwa "
"biyandikishije gusubiza ibyifuzo byo gutwara."

msgid "Keep useful records"
msgstr "Bika inyandiko z'ingirakamaro"

msgid ""
"Log storage inspections and farm costs to support better decisions over "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Andika igenzura ry'ububiko n'ibiciro by'ubuhinzi kugira ngo bifashe gufata "
"ibyemezo byiza."

msgid "Built for real-world decisions."
msgstr "Yagenewe gufasha gufata ibyemezo bifatika."

msgid ""
"Harvest dates are estimates, matches are opportunities—not guarantees—and "
"storage reminders do not certify produce safety."
msgstr ""
"Amatariki yo gusarura ni ibigereranyo, ibihuye ni amahirwe atari isezerano, "
"kandi ibyibutsa iby'ububiko ntibyemeza ko umusaruro utekanye."

