msgstr "Andika ubushobozi bw'ikinyabiziga cyawe mu kilo."

msgid "Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ only."
msgstr "Ni ngombwa. Nturenze inyuguti 150. Koresha inyuguti, imibare na @/./+/-/_ gusa."

msgid "Your password can’t be too similar to your other personal information."
msgstr "Ijambo ry'ibanga ntirigomba gusa cyane n'andi makuru yawe bwite."

msgid "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d character."
msgid_plural "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d characters."
msgstr[0] "Ijambo ry'ibanga rigomba kugira nibura inyuguti %(min_length)d."
msgstr[1] "Ijambo ry'ibanga rigomba kugira nibura inyuguti %(min_length)d."

msgid "Your password can’t be a commonly used password."
msgstr "Ijambo ry'ibanga ntirigomba kuba irikoreshwa na benshi."

msgid "Your password can’t be entirely numeric."
msgstr "Ijambo ry'ibanga ntirigomba kuba rigizwe n'imibare gusa."

msgid "Enter the same password as before, for verification."
msgstr "Ongera wandike ijambo ry'ibanga risa n'irya mbere kugira ngo ryemezwe."

msgid ""
"Set the requested quantity, proposed price, collection date, and delivery "
"location. Prices are proposals until agreed."
msgstr ""
"Andika ingano ukeneye, igiciro utanze, itariki yo gutwara n'aho bigomba "
"kugezwa. Ibiciro ni ibyifuzo kugeza mwumvikanyeho."

msgid ""
"Provide the pickup location, destination, pickup date, and optional cost."
msgstr ""
"Andika aho bazakura umusaruro, aho bawujyana, itariki yo kuwutwara n'ikiguzi"
" ushaka kugaragaza."

